<title>AUSTRALIA: MBIA/AMBAC opens Sydney office.</title>
<headline>MBIA/AMBAC opens Sydney office.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. municipal bond insurance joint venture MBIA/AMBAC Inc said on Sunday it had opened an office in Sydney to service the Asia and Pacific Rim regions.</p>
<p>&quot;We see significant demand for financial guarantee insurance in the region because of its ability to lower financing costs and improve the marketability of infrastructure, securitization and structure finance transactions,&quot; said Christopher Weeks, director of Asia-Pacific Rim MBIA/AMBAC Inc.</p>
<p>MBIA/AMBAC International is an unincorporated reinsurance joint venture between U.S.-based financial guarantors MBIA Insurance Corp and AMBAC Indemnity Corp.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
